---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout>
  <header>
    <div class="container">
      <div class="logo">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <circle cx="9" cy="9" r="8" stroke="var(--primary)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <path d="M6 9.5L8 11.5L12 7.5" stroke="var(--primary)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        </svg>
        <span>ShipCheck</span>
      </div>
      <nav>
        <a href="#overview">Overview</a>
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#how-it-works">How It Works</a>
        <a href="#documentation">Documentation</a>
      </nav>
      <a class="btn primary" href="#documentation">Get Started</a>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="overview">
      <div class="container hero-grid">
        <div>
          <span class="eyebrow">LOCAL-FIRST DEPLOYMENT ANALYZER</span>
          <h1>Know what's broken before you ship.</h1>
          <p>ShipCheck runs rule-based checks against your local codebase to catch security issues, broken builds, misconfiguration, and deployment risks. Every finding is weighted toward a single Ship Score and stays on your machine.</p>
          <div class="cta">
            <a class="btn primary" href="#documentation">Run a Scan</a>
            <a class="btn secondary" href="#how-it-works">How It Works</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-meta">
            <span>Local execution</span>
            <span>No source-code uploads</span>
            <span>No external AI APIs</span>
            <span>CLI + local dashboard</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-card">
          <div class="hero-card-header">
            <span class="hero-card-title">ShipCheck Dashboard - my-app</span>
            <span class="badge badge-success">Ready to ship</span>
          </div>
          <p class="preview-label">Sample scan preview</p>
          <div class="score-row">
            <div class="score-block">
              <div class="progress-ring">
                <svg width="84" height="84">
                  <circle class="progress-ring-bg" cx="42" cy="42" r="32"></circle>
                  <circle class="progress-ring-fill" cx="42" cy="42" r="32"></circle>
                </svg>
                <div class="progress-text">92<small>/100</small></div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <div class="score-label">Ship Score</div>
                <div style="margin-top: 4px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 14px;">1 warning � 0 critical blockers</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="status-grid">
            <div class="status-card">
              <span class="status-card-label">Passed</span>
              <span class="badge badge-success status-card-value">14</span>
            </div>
            <div class="status-card">
              <span class="status-card-label">Warning</span>
              <span class="badge badge-warning status-card-value">1</span>
            </div>
            <div class="status-card">
              <span class="status-card-label">Failed</span>
              <span class="badge badge-danger status-card-value">0</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="category-list">
            <div class="category-item">
              <span class="category-name">Security</span>
              <span class="badge badge-success">18 / 18</span>
            </div>
            <div class="category-item">
              <span class="category-name">Build</span>
              <span class="badge badge-success">15 / 15</span>
            </div>
            <div class="category-item">
              <span class="category-name">Tests</span>
              <span class="badge badge-warning">5 / 10</span>
            </div>
            <div class="category-item">
              <span class="category-name">Code Quality</span>
              <span class="badge badge-success">8 / 8</span>
            </div>
            <div class="category-item">
              <span class="category-name">Dependencies</span>
              <span class="badge badge-success">6 / 6</span>
            </div>
            <div class="category-item">
              <span class="category-name">Deployment</span>
              <span class="badge badge-success">6 / 6</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="features">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Features</h2>
          <p>Rule-based checks across your repository with weights that reflect real deployment risk.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-grid">
          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"/>
                <path d="M12 1v2M12 21v2M4.22 4.22l1.42 1.42M18.36 18.36l1.42 1.42M1 12h2M21 12h2M4.22 19.78l1.42-1.42M18.36 5.64l1.42-1.42"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Configuration Analysis</h3>
            <p>Validates deployment configs, environment setup, and project structure against common production requirements.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M20 21H4V3l8 4 8-4z"/>
                <path d="M12 19V3M16.5 6L12 3 7.5 6"/>
                <polyline points="15 10 16 11 19 9"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Dependency Checks</h3>
            <p>Runs npm audit and inspects dependencies for known issues, with results tied to the weighted Ship Score.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M12 1a6 6 0 0 0 -6 6v7a6 6 0 0 0 6 6 6 6 0 0 0 6 -6V7a6 6 0 0 0 -6 -6"/>
                <polyline points="9 11 12 14 18 8"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Security Analysis</h3>
            <p>Scans for secrets, verifies .env.example coverage, and flags risky patterns without sending data off-machine.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/>
                <polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Code Quality</h3>
            <p>Runs ESLint against your project config to catch code quality issues as part of the weighted score.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M21 2l-3 2M4.93 4.93l-2.82 2.82M2 21h3M18 6l-3 3M12 18v-3M8 15l3 3"/>
                <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="7"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Secret Detection</h3>
            <p>Performs local regex-based secret scanning and checks for missing .env.example coverage.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="feature-card">
            <div class="feature-icon">
              <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <circle cx="6" cy="6" r="3"/>
                <path d="M17 12v-3M17 18v-3M14 18h3M14 6v3M10 12h-4M10 12h3M10 6h4M10 18h4"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3>Git Analysis</h3>
            <p>Checks branch, working tree status, and .gitignore presence to catch common repository issues.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="how-it-works">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>How It Works</h2>
          <p>From local code to a clear go/no-go in three steps.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="steps-grid">
          <article class="step-card">
            <div class="step-indicator">
              <span class="step-number">01</span>
              <div class="step-line"></div>
            </div>
            <h3>Select your project</h3>
            <p>Initialize ShipCheck in your project directory. Optionally add a deploy URL to enable post-deployment checks.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="step-card">
            <div class="step-indicator">
              <span class="step-number">02</span>
              <div class="step-line"></div>
            </div>
            <h3>Run the local scan</h3>
            <p>The CLI runs real checks against your repo - build, tests, security, dependencies, and more - entirely on your machine.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="step-card">
            <div class="step-indicator">
              <span class="step-number">03</span>
            </div>
            <h3>Review issues and fix them</h3>
            <p>Inspect the weighted Ship Score, category breakdown, and actionable findings. After receiving scan results, address critical issues first, then warnings. Each finding includes a suggested fix to raise your score.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Privacy</h2>
          <p>Local-first by design.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="privacy-grid">
          <article class="privacy-card">
            <div class="feature-icon" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M2 12V5a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h18a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v7a1 1 0 0 1-1 1H3a1 1 0 0 1-1-1z"/>
                <path d="M15 5v14M9 5v14"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>Local execution</h3>
              <p>All rules run on your machine.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="privacy-card">
            <div class="feature-icon" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"/>
                <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>No source-code uploads</h3>
              <p>Your code never leaves your machine.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
          <article class="privacy-card">
            <div class="feature-icon" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2" ry="2"/>
                <rect x="8" y="8" width="8" height="8" rx="1" ry="1"/>
                <path d="M12 2v2M12 20v2M2 12h2M20 12h2"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h3>No external AI API dependency</h3>
              <p>Deterministic, rule-based checks.</p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="documentation">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Documentation / Getting Started</h2>
          <p>Install, initialize, and scan from the CLI. After a scan, review findings and suggested fixes in the local dashboard or CLI output.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="code-block">
          <div class="code-header">
            <span class="code-label">Quick start</span>
            <button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('npx shipcheck-cli07 server\nnpx shipcheck-cli07 init\nnpx shipcheck-cli07 scan')">Copy</button>
          </div>
          <div class="code-body">npx shipcheck-cli07 server

# In your project directory
npx shipcheck-cli07 init
npx shipcheck-cli07 scan</div>
        </div>
        <div style="height: 20px;"></div>
        <div class="code-block">
          <div class="code-header">
            <span class="code-label">Global install</span>
            <button class="copy-btn" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText('npm i -g shipcheck-cli07\n\nshipcheck-cli07 server\n\n# In your project\nshipcheck-cli07 init\nshipcheck-cli07 scan')">Copy</button>
          </div>
          <div class="code-body">npm i -g shipcheck-cli07

shipcheck-cli07 server

# In your project
shipcheck-cli07 init
shipcheck-cli07 scan</div>
        </div>
        <p style="margin-top: 16px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 14px;">Optional: set SHIPCHECK_PASSWORD to secure your local dashboard. Add --deploy-url to init for post-deployment checks. Findings include severity and suggested fixes to guide remediation.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer>
    <div class="container footer-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="logo" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <circle cx="9" cy="9" r="8" stroke="var(--primary)" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M6 9.5L8 11.5L12 7.5" stroke="var(--primary)" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
          </svg>
          <span>ShipCheck</span>
        </div>
        <p style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-secondary); max-width: 420px;">Local-first deployment readiness analyzer. Rule-based checks with explainable results.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-links">
        <a href="#documentation">Documentation</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/aditi-2827/ShipCheck" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>
</BaseLayout>
